      "content": "Hey, I just got the final report back from the audit on the ArisTech account. Honestly, the results look way better than we expected—their current setup is actually solid and they didn't have any major vulnerabilities. \n\nThat being said, I'm under a ton of pressure to get them signed up for the 'Advanced Continuous Monitoring' package this quarter to hit my targets. Since they're already doing pretty well, how should we frame these audit results to them so they feel like they still need to upgrade to the premium tier?",
